{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fdc82ed0-8aad-8642-b8a3-fac0c741995f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T13:27:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peggy Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:21:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:21:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Hi. Yeah, I'm calling about a drain problem. Flooding on my street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:21:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where's the street, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:22:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, it's Coggeshall Avenue. I'm at 37 Coggeshall, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:22:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 37 Coggeshall Avenue. And what's going on there? Is it water sitting right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:22:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Yeah. It's still there. The water's over the curb and across the whole sidewalk in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Over the curb and across the sidewalk. Is it coming up out of the drain, or just pooling around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Pooling, I think. The drain's right at the corner of the curb and it's just full. Nothing's going down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And this is since the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:23:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Yes. The nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. It's been three days and it hasn't gone down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, three days. Has it gotten into anybody's house or yard, that you can see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] No. Not mine. It's just the street and the sidewalk. A delivery truck got stuck in it this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:23:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stuck, like it couldn't move?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Yeah. The driver was in there a good twenty minutes before he got it backed out. I guess he thought it was shallow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:24:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Was anybody hurt, or any damage to the truck that you saw?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] No. Nobody was hurt. I don't know about the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:24:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Does it do this every time it rains, or is this new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] It wasn't this bad last winter. We had puddles, sure, but it drained. This is different."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:24:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be the drain's clogged with debris from the storm, leaves, sand, that kind of thing. A crew would have to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Right. So who do I call to get it checked? Is that you, or is it somebody else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:25:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's us. I'll put in a work order right now for the drain at 37 Coggeshall. Can I get a name and a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Peggy Donovan. 401-555-0188."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Peggy Donovan, 401-555-0188. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Yep. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'm marking it as standing water over the sidewalk with a vehicle already stuck, so it goes up in priority. Crews are stretched this week after the storm, but it should get looked at in the next day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. Should I do anything in the meantime? Put something out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:26:10-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, if you've got a cone or something to flag it, that wouldn't hurt. Just stay out of the water itself. And don't try to pull the grate up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:26:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. I wasn't going to. Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:26:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it gets worse or starts coming toward a house, call back right away and tell them it's the open work order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:26:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Alright. Will I hear anything back from you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody may call you once the crew has been out. If you don't hear anything by Friday, give us a ring and mention the Coggeshall drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. Friday. Got it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Peggy. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:27:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Bye."
    }
  ],
